+//! of the steps is `install`'s; this file only reaches the system.
+//!
+//! - The service of an installed PC (`ThisPc`): a folder under the local application data of
+//!   SYSTEM that only SYSTEM and administrators reach, file handles that keep everyone else from
+//!   writing, the start of the installer as SYSTEM, the warning on the user's desktop.
+//! - The main window of an installed PC: the signal to the service and the service's answer.
+//! - An app that is not installed: the download into the user's Downloads and the start of the
+//!   new file in place of this process.
+
+use super::{
+    door::{self, DoorRequest, Failure},
+    fetch::{self, Kind},
+    install::{self, Facts, Machine, Started},
